  "body": "Set well back from the road and beautifully positioned to enjoy a peaceful and private setting, this appealing home offers an inviting sense of space and tranquillity.\r\n\r\nFeaturing two well-proportioned bedrooms and a generous bathroom, the home enjoys an abundance of sunshine and natural light throughout. The open-plan kitchen, living and dining area creates an easy, relaxed living environment, flowing seamlessly outdoors to a generous timber deck, expansive lawn and beautifully established gardens.\r\n\r\nIncredibly private and wonderfully peaceful, this is a home where you can relax, unwind and enjoy the outdoors. Complete with a carport along with additional off-street parking and excellent storage options.\r\n\r\nYou will love the convenience of being just a short stroll from Kohimarama Primary School, Madills Farm, local playground, Kohimarama Beach and a wonderful selection of local amenities.\r\n\r\nAn exceptional opportunity to embrace an enviable lifestyle location, properties like this are rare and seldom available. This is your chance to secure a home in a highly desirable neighbourhood and enjoy the benefits of a wonderful community. \r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to settle in, downsize or secure a foothold in this sought-after location, this is an opportunity well worth your attention.",
